	<br><br>
	<<swimicon "back">><<link [[물살을 거슬러 헤엄친다 (0:05)|Sewers Commercial Swim]]>><<pass 5>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><<swimmingdifficulty 1 400>><<gtiredness>>
	<br>
